### ========================================
### CATEGORY ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Create Category
POST http://localhost:8081/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shoes",
  "description": "Footwear"
}

### List Categories
GET http://localhost:8081/api/categories

### Get Category by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/categories/1

### 404 case - category that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:8081/api/categories/999

### Update Category
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/admin/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shoes & Sneakers",
  "description": "Footwear for everyone"
}

### Validation error - missing required name
POST http://localhost:8081/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "no name here"
}

### Delete Category
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/admin/categories/1


### ========================================
### PRODUCT ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Create Product
POST http://localhost:8081/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "Running Sneaker",
  "description": "Lightweight daily trainer",
  "sku": "RUN-001",
  "brand": "Nova",
  "price": 899.99,
  "stockQuantity": 50
}

### List Products
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products

### Filter Products by category
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products?categoryId=1

### Search Products by name
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/search?query=sneaker

### Get Product by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/1

### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/admin/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "Running Sneaker Pro",
  "description": "Updated lightweight daily trainer",
  "sku": "RUN-001",
  "brand": "Nova",
  "price": 949.99,
  "stockQuantity": 40
}

### 404 case - product that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/999

### 404 case - bad category id on create
POST http://localhost:8081/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 999,
  "name": "Ghost Product",
  "price": 10.00,
  "stockQuantity": 5
}

### Validation error - missing required name
POST http://localhost:8081/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "price": 10.00,
  "stockQuantity": 5
}

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/admin/products/1